general procedure of acylation with an acid chloride
N,N-hexanoyltosylhydrazide (4): white crystals. mp 91 °C (recrystalized
from hexane-ethyl acetate); IR (neat) 3389, 3315, 2957, 2931, 2871, 1689,
1453, 1349, 1168, 1134, 913, cm-1; 1HNMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.89 (d, J =
