3H), 1.59 (quint, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H), 1.23-1.33 (m, 4H), 0.87 (t, J = 7.5
Hz, 3H); 1H NMR (500 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ 7.84 (d, J = 8.1 Hz, 2H), 7.38 (d, J
= 8.1 Hz, 2H), 5.63 (s, 2H), 2.40-2.55 (m, 2H), 2.38 (s, 3H), 1.38
(quint, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H), 1.21-1.10 (m, 4H), 0.79 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 3H); 13C
NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 174.7, 145.1, 134.9, 129.5, 128.7, 35.6, 31.2,
24.0, 22.4, 21.7, 13.9; HRMS (EI) m/z [M]+ calcd for [C13H20N2O3S]+
284.1195, found 284.1205. N'-hexanoyl-N-tosylhydrazide (5): colorless
crystals. mp 100 °C (recrystalized from hexane-ethyl acetate); IR (neat)
3244, 2955, 2925, 2863, 1672, 1455, 1343, 1167, 812, cm-1; 1H NMR (500
MHz, CDCl3) δ 7.78 (d, J = 8.6 Hz, 2H), 7.59 (d, J = 6.3 Hz, 1H), 7.30
(d, J = 8.0 Hz, 2H), 2.43 (s, 3H), 2.04 (t, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H), 1.41 (quint,
