2.9 Hz, 1H), 9.66 (d, J = 2.9 Hz, 1H), 7.65 (d, J = 8.6 Hz, 2H), 7.32 (d,
J = 8.0 Hz, 2H), 2.36 (s, 3H), 1.92 (t, J = 6.9 Hz, 2H), 1.29 (quint, J =
7.5 Hz, 2H), 1.17 (sextet, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H), 1.03 (quint, J = 7.5 Hz, 2H),
